# Claude Code tool allowlists, skill caches, session state — never commit.
# Files under .claude/ embed dev-machine tool permission allowlists which can
# include literal credentials from past sessions (RDS passwords, bastion key
# paths, etc.). Broadened from `.claude/settings.local.json` to the whole
# directory 2026-05-28 after a credential leak surfaced in the prod-rel-4.1.6
# cutover — see docs/findings/dev-team-asks-2026-05-28.md (item 2).
.claude/

